ext":"雙手緊握","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[3]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"仔細觀察","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[3]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"壓制對手","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據全文，下列哪一句最適合作為本文結語？","n":20,"ssz":"........1..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"思考會讓你的思想更強大","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不怕你犯錯，只要你改過","n":11,"ssz":"1.........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"人生要放慢腳步，才能欣賞沿途的美景","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"自律讓人進步，挫折也能帶來成長","n":15,"ssz":"..............1"},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＜200字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"還要多加練習。","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"201~230字","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"嗯，還不錯喲！","n":7,"ssz":"...1..."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＞231字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"哇嗚，超級厲害！","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:key_reading.instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請用計時器，從指定段落（四☞）開始朗讀，計時1分鐘讀的字數，並記錄在表格中。如果你計時3次後，對自己還不滿意，可以自己多練幾次喔。最後一次，找一位同學，請他來計時、記錄並簽名！","n":88,"ssz":"...............................................................1.......1................"},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第1次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第2次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第3次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裁判計時","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.unit","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"字","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:key_reading.start_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"心、體、技，缺一不可。競技場上，除了體能和技術，","n":24,"ssz":"....................1..."},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小安答應幫忙收作業。他說：「交給我，我會整理好。」放學前，他仔細清點，發現少了一份，便主動提醒同學補交。\n「交給我，我會整理好」是小安說的話；「仔細清點、主動提醒同學」是小安做的事。從小安說話和做的事，可以看出他很負責任。「負責任」是人物特質。\n人物特質，就是一個人常表現出來的做事方式或態度。文章有時會直接寫出人物特質，有時則要從人物說的話和做的事來推論。\n本課一開始就寫出楊勇緯具有「自律」和「強韌的心理素質」。接下來，我們要練習回到課文，找出能支持這些特質的言行。\n我們可以用三個步驟，找出能說明人物特質的言行：\n❶找特質：課文寫出人物具有什麼特質？\n❷找言行：哪些話或做法能看出這個特質？\n❸對一對：這些言行真的能說明這個特質嗎？","n":319,"ssz":"..11............................................................................................1..................................1.......................................1..........2..............1............................................1...................................................1...................1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小安答應幫忙收作業。他說：「交給我，我會整理好。」放學前，他仔細清點，發現少了一份，便主動提醒同學補交。","n":52,"ssz":"..11................................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「交給我，我會整理好」是小安說的話；「仔細清點、主動提醒同學」是小安做的事。從小安說話和做的事，可以看出他很負責任。「負責任」是人物特質。","n":69,"ssz":"...........................................1........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"人物特質，就是一個人常表現出來的做事方式或態度。文章有時會直接寫出人物特質，有時則要從人物說的話和做的事來推論。","n":56,"ssz":"........1.......................................1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"本課一開始就寫出楊勇緯具有「自律」和「強韌的心理素質」。接下來，我們要練習回到課文，找出能支持這些特質的言行。","n":55,"ssz":"..2..............1....................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我們可以用三個步驟，找出能說明人物特質的言行：","n":23,"ssz":"......1................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶找特質：課文寫出人物具有什麼特質？","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷找言行：哪些話或做法能看出這個特質？","n":19,"ssz":"...............1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❸對一對：這些言行真的能說明這個特質嗎？","n":20,"ssz":"...............1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、判斷：這是人物特質？還是言行？","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請判斷下面的內容是人物「做的事」、「說的話」，還是「人物特質」，並在正確的格子裡打勾。","n":43,"ssz":"......................................1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"內容","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"做的事","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"說的話","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"人物特質","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].rows[0].內容","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"①「我的任務，我一定會做好。」","n":15,"ssz":"........1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].rows[1].內容","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"②輪到他照顧班級植物，他每天都記得澆水。","n":20,"ssz":"................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].rows[2].內容","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"③負責任","n":4,"s