":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].rows[5].文中線索","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"⑥隨時記下每天所學和需要注意的事情。","n":18,"ssz":".........1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→你發現了嗎？不是所有人物說的話、做的事，都能支持同一項特質。能支持「自律」的線索，要能看出人物會要求自己、按照計畫行動。","n":61,"ssz":".......1..................1......................1..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三、合起來想：這些線索表現出什麼特質？","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀一讀下面的線索，先勾選最符合的說明，再想想這些線索有什麼共同點？","n":33,"ssz":"................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"從線索可以看出……","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].rows[0].文中線索","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"①被對手壓制時，他仍能冷靜應對，找機會將劣勢轉為優勢。","n":27,"ssz":".............1............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].rows[0].從線索可以看出……_options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"遇到壓力時，仍能冷靜思考應對方法。","n":17,"ssz":"............1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].rows[0].從線索可以看出……_options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他的柔道技巧很好，每次都能取得優勢。","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].rows[1].文中線索","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"②「先深呼吸冷靜，再調整好心情重新開始，然後思考應該再做些什麼。」","n":33,"ssz":"...............1................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].rows[1].從線索可以看出……_options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"只要按照固定步驟調整，就能贏得比賽。","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].rows[1].從線索可以看出……_options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"受到干擾時，懂得調整自己、重新專注。","n":18,"ssz":".......1.....1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].rows[2].文中線索","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"③東奧失利後，他持續調整改進，後來奪下兩面柔道大滿貫金牌。","n":29,"ssz":"............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].rows[2].從線索可以看出……_options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"te